<title>USA: Times Mirror issues $148 mln 100-year debt.</title>
<headline>Times Mirror issues $148 mln 100-year debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 100-year debt</p>
<p>issue from Times Mirror Co was priced on Thursday, according</p>
<p>to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER TIMES MIRROR CO</p>
<p>AMT $148 MLN	 COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 11/15/2096</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 99.614  FIRST PAY DATE 5/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 7.278 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD 74 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>UNDERLYING U.S. TREASURY -- 6-3/4 PCT BOND DUE 2026 U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
